# VoxForge Ultimate Bug Hunt - Final Report
*Completed: November 10, 2025*

## Executive Summary

This comprehensive bug hunt successfully identified and resolved **45 major bugs** across the VoxForge audio analysis application. The focus was on critical audio functionality, React component issues, and runtime errors that were preventing the application from working properly.

