## 🔧 Technical Implementation Highlights

### **Audio System Overhaul**
- **Isolated AudioContext instances** - Each playback gets its own context to prevent conflicts
- **Proper gain control** - Volume control with gain nodes instead of direct manipulation
- **Enhanced error handling** - Try-catch blocks with user-friendly error messages
- **Memory management** - Proper cleanup of audio resources and event listeners

### **Visualization System Replacement**
- **Removed PixiJS dependency** - Eliminated heavy, problematic 3D graphics library
- **Simple HTML5 Canvas** - Lightweight, fast 2D visualization that works reliably
- **Grid-based piano roll display** - Clean, musical interface for note visualization
- **Real-time updates** - Proper animation frames and state management

### **React Component Improvements**
- **Fixed hook violations** - Proper useEffect dependencies and cleanup
- **Enhanced accessibility** - Better ARIA labels, screen reader support
- **Performance optimizations** - Reduced unnecessary re-renders
- **Error boundaries** - Graceful error handling and recovery

